class Solution {
    public int largestAltitude(int[] gain) {
        int altitude =0; // starting altitude is 0
        int maxaltitude = 0;
        
        // Traverse the gain array
        for(int g: gain){
            altitude+=g;
            maxaltitude=Math.max(maxaltitude, altitude);
        }
        return maxaltitude;
    }
}


Complexity
Time: O(n) (single pass through gain).
Space: O(1) (just two variables).
